1:["$","$Le",null,{"record":{"slug":"field-theatre","section":"practice","title":["帮腔·田野共生","Joining Voices in the Field"],"date":"2025.11","status":["研习营小组成果","Study camp group work"],"summary":["从搭建竹帐篷到海报共创，让非遗传承人与青年共同表达。图版标题另作“田野共声”，保留原稿版本。","Building a bamboo tent and co-creating posters brought opera practitioners and young people into a shared expression. The artwork uses a variant Chinese title."],"image":"/assets/editorial/group-17.jpg","caption":["2025研习营过程与成果图版，汇报 PDF 第17页。","2025 study camp process and outcome, presentation p.17."],"topic":true,"tags":[["平讲戏非遗活化 · 文化","Pingjiang opera · Culture"]],"chapters":[{"title":"$1:props:record:tags:0","text":"$1:props:record:summary"},{"title":["参与者","Participants"],"text":["专业导师：胡冬竹；在地共创导师：潘家挺。学员：廖纯誉、陈怡如、郑钰彤、申彧凡。","Specialist mentor: Hu Dongzhu. Local mentor: Pan Jiating. Participants: Liao Chunyu, Chen Yiru, Zheng Yutong and Shen Yufan."]},{"title":["本届研习营评价","Recognition within the camp"],"text":["获得“社区链接奖”。这是2025研习营内的成果评价，不属于全国竞赛奖项。","Received the Community Connection Award within the 2025 camp, separate from national competition awards."]}],"related":["camp-2025","diverse-foods"],"sources":["camp","overview"],"credits":["设计导师（据研习营资料）：Tricia Austin、Allan Parsons（原文Allen）、姚之洁、蔡文超、黄晓菲。具体组别署名以原文及最终名单为准。","Design mentors listed in camp materials: Tricia Austin, Allan Parsons (Allen in the source), Yao Zhijie, Cai Wenchao and Huang Xiaofei. Refer to source and final rosters for group attribution."]}}]
